Technical Proposal
I1.Program Narrative (2 Page Limit)
The Laramie County Juvenile Services Joint Powers Board (LCJSJPB) stated in their Strategic Plan
Youth Alternatives (YA) was“a major contributor” to the high level of services within the
continuum of care in Laramie County.Youth Alternatives past record of collaboration has produced
programs like the Adolescent Day Treatment Center, Special
Friends, Alternative Center for.Community Involvement and School
Goal Summary
